# API App (`apps/api`)

## Route Structure

```
apps/api/src/app/api/
  [[...rest]]/route.ts   — catch-all for oRPC + OpenAPI
  auth/[...all]/route.ts — Better Auth handlers
```

No other route files. All business logic lives in `packages/orpc/src/routers/`.

## Key Patterns

- CORS headers applied globally in `[[...rest]]/route.ts` — never add per-route CORS
- Errors serialised via `payload.ts` — never expose raw stack traces in production
- OpenTelemetry flushed before response on Vercel (`tracing.flushTelemetry()`)

## Trigger.dev

- Config: `apps/api/trigger.config.ts` — `maxDuration: 1800`, `dirs: ["./src/trigger"]`
- Task re-exports for CLI discovery: `apps/api/src/trigger/organize.ts`
- Dev script: `pnpm trigger:dev` (reads `HARMONIA_TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY` via `scripts/run-trigger-dev.mjs`)

## Environment

- Loaded via `scripts/with-root-env.mjs` (maps `HARMONIA_TRIGGER_*` → `TRIGGER_*`)
- Import env: `import { apiEnv } from "@harmonia/env/presets/api"`
